```mermaid
flowchart LR
    PC["Saha bf-<no>"] -->|WG tüneli| WG["WireGuard hub"]
    WG --> SSH["SSH / Ansible"]
    WG --> RDP["xRDP + GNOME"]
    PC -->|doğrudan internet<br/>VDS genel adresi| RD["RustDesk hbbs/hbbr"]
    PC -->|doğrudan internet<br/>VDS genel adresi| MC["MeshCentral"]
    WG -.->|çökerse| DOWN{"WG down?"}
    DOWN -->|evet| RD
    DOWN -->|evet| MC
```
